From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yassine Oudjana <y.oudjana@protonmail.com>
Date: Tue, 11 May 2021 19:21:11 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] HACK: arm64: dts: qcom: xiaomi-scorpio: Remove power-domains
 from MDP SMMU

Letting the SMMU have power domains allows PM runtime to be enabled and it
to be suspended and reset as a result. This must not happen to allow simplefb
to continue working until DRM takes over.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-xiaomi-scorpio.dts | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-xiaomi-scorpio.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-xiaomi-scorpio.dts
index 44407e6bcf..e370839746 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-xiaomi-scorpio.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8996pro-xiaomi-scorpio.dts
@@ -99,6 +99,13 @@ &mdp_smmu {
 	 */
 	qcom,no-smr-check;
 	qcom,skip-init;
+
+	/*
+	 * HACK: Remove power-domains to stop SMMU from being suspended
+	 * and losing simplefb as a result. MMAGIC_MDSS_GDSC is flagged
+	 * always-on so it does not need any consumers to stay on.
+	 */
+	 /delete-property/ power-domains;
 };
 
 &mdss {
